<% if (_status === 'submitted') { %>
Invoice Submitted — Review Required
=====================================

A vendor has submitted an invoice for the maintenance request below.
Please approve or reject at your earliest convenience.

INVOICE SUMMARY
---------------
Reference #:    <%= request.mruid %>
Job Title:      <%= request.title %>
Invoice Amount: $<%= (amount / 100).toFixed(2) %> <%= (request.invoice && request.invoice.currency) ? request.invoice.currency.toUpperCase() : 'USD' %>
Submitted:      <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %>
<% if (request.invoice && request.invoice.description) { %>Description:    <%= request.invoice.description %>
<% } %>
Log in to the portal to approve or reject this invoice.
<% } else if (_status === 'approved') { %>
Invoice Approved
================

Your invoice for the maintenance job below has been approved.
Payment will be processed according to the agreed terms.

APPROVAL DETAILS
----------------
Reference #:    <%= request.mruid %>
Job:            <%= request.title %>
<% if (request.invoice) { %>Approved Amount: $<%= (request.invoice.amount / 100).toFixed(2) %> <%= request.invoice.currency.toUpperCase() %>
Approved By:    <%= approvedBy.firstName || approvedBy.email %>
Approved On:    <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %>
For questions about payment timing, contact the property manager directly.
<% } else if (_status === 'rejected') { %>
Invoice Rejected — Resubmission Required
==========================================

Your invoice for the maintenance job below has been rejected.
Please review the reason and submit a corrected invoice.

REJECTION DETAILS
-----------------
Reference #: <%= request.mruid %>
Job:         <%= request.title %>
Rejected By: <%= rejectedBy.firstName || rejectedBy.email %>
Reason:      <%= rejectionReason %>

Log in to the portal to submit a revised invoice.

If you believe this rejection is in error, contact <%= rejectedBy.firstName || rejectedBy.email %><% if (rejectedBy.email) { %> at <%= rejectedBy.email %><% } %>.
<% } %>
